#: caja-dropbox.in:67
msgid ""
"Dropbox is the easiest way to share and store your files online. Want to "
"learn more? Head to"
msgstr ""
"Dropbox is de lichteste Weg, diene Dateien im Internett so spiekern un to "
"delen. Willst du mehr lehren? Bekiek"

#: caja-dropbox.in:69
msgid "In order to use Dropbox, you must download the proprietary daemon."
msgstr ""
"Um Dropbox to bruken, muttst du de unfrejen Achtergrundprozess runnerladen."

#: caja-dropbox.in:70
msgid ""
"Note: python-gpg (python-gpgme for Ubuntu 16.10 and lower) is not installed,"
" we will not be able to verify binary signatures."
msgstr ""
"Wahrschau: python-gpg (python-gpgme för Ubuntu 16.10 un oller) is nich "
"installeert, wi könen nich de Binäär-Unnerschriften prüfen."

#: caja-dropbox.in:71
msgid ""
"Trouble connecting to Dropbox servers. Maybe your internet connection is "
"down, or you need to set your http_proxy environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Probleem bi’m Verbinnen mit de Dropbox-Servern. Villicht büst du nich mit de"
" Internett verbunnen, of du muttst diene http_proxy-Umgevens-Variaabel "
"setten."

#: caja-dropbox.in:72
msgid "Downloaded binary does not match Dropbox signature, aborting install."
msgstr ""
"Runnerlade Binäärdatei passt nich to de Dropbox-Unnerschrift, breckt dat "
"Installeren of."

#: caja-dropbox.in:73
msgid ""
"Could not start the Dropbox daemon. Make sure your computer meets the minimum requirements:\n"
"https://www.dropbox.com/help/desktop-web/system-requirements#desktop"
msgstr ""
"Kunn de Dropbox-Achtergrundprozess nich starten. Wees wiss, dat dien Reekner up de Minnst-Anförderns passt:\n"
"https://www.dropbox.com/help/desktop-web/systeem-requirements#desktop"

#: caja-dropbox.in:78
#, c-format
msgid "Downloading Dropbox... %d%%"
msgstr "Lade Dropbox runner … %d%%"

#: caja-dropbox.in:79
#, c-format
msgid "Unpacking Dropbox... %d%%"
msgstr "Packe Dropbox ut … %d%%"

#: caja-dropbox.in:451
msgid "Dropbox Installation"
msgstr "Dropbox Installeren"

#: caja-dropbox.in:512
msgid "_Don't show this again"
msgstr "Nich _weer wiesen"

#: data/caja-dropbox.desktop.in:4
msgid "Caja Dropbox"
msgstr "Caja Dropbox"

#: data/caja-dropbox.desktop.in:5
msgid "File Synchronizer For Mate"
msgstr "Datei-Gliekholler för MATE"

#: data/caja-dropbox.desktop.in:6
msgid "Installs and launches proprietary Dropbox cloud software"
msgstr "Installeert un start de unfreje Dropbox-Cloud-Software"

#: data/caja-dropbox.desktop.in:13
msgid "file;synchronization;sharing;collaboration;cloud;storage;backup;"
msgstr "Datei;gliekhollen;delen;tosamenwarken;cloud;Spieker;Sekerheidskopie;"
